    "bodyText": "Home\nAbout Us\nServices\nWhy Us?\nFAQ\nArticles\nTestimonials\nContact Us\nContact Us\nNew Jersey's Finest HVAC Services\nHVAC Inspection, Maintenance, and Installation! Free Estimate and Same Day Service Guarantee!\nFree Estimate\nOur Services\n\nWHY US?\n\nWhen you choose Blueray Heating and Cooling, you’re choosing\n\nReliability and High-Quality Services\n\nReliability is at the core of our values at Blueray…\n\nRead More\n\nHVAC Expertise and Experience\n\nWith 20+ years of experience in the HVAC industry, our…\n\nRead More\n\nCustomer Satisfaction as Our Priority\n\nYour satisfaction is paramount to us at Blueray Heating and…\n\nRead More\n\nNorth Jersey’s Preferred HVAC Experts\n\nBlueray Heating and Cooling takes pride in being North Jersey’s…\n\nRead More\n\nSeamless Indoor Comfort Solutions\n\nExperience the Blueray difference today and elevate the comfort of…\n\nRead More\n\nAbout Blueray\n\nAt Blueray Heating and Cooling, we’re dedicated to keeping your home comfortable all year round. Our team of HVAC experts is committed to providing high-quality heating, cooling, and indoor air quality solutions for your home or business.\n\n0+\nExperienced people on the team\n0+\nСities where employees work\nRead MoreOur Video\nContact us today!\n\nReady to experience the Blueray Heating and Cooling difference? Whether it’s an emergency or an installation, we’re only one click away!\n\n\tContact Us\n\nTESTIMONIALS\n\nOur Customers Say\n\nMy heating and cooling system has been better than ever since Matt came to fix them. He was recommended to me by some coworkers and it was the best decision of my life.\n\nMohammed Odatalla\n\nWe use them for all our plumbing, heating and cooling needs. Hamza is very knowledgeable and always helps find the best solution. Whenever I have a plumbing emergency I never panic because I know Blu-ray is only one phone call away. And the best part is they do residential and commercial they have worked in my house and my restaurants. Keep up the amazing work\n\nSaad Basra\n\nMatt came to check on the unit last week, he was nice and really honest with his opinion on the unit. We had initially called a different company, and Blueray was our second opinion. We decided to go with Blueray.\nWe just had our AC unit replaced today and we just want to share we had a good experience with Blueray HVAC. Thank you! Matt and Sam are very friendly and professional. I highly recommend them!\n\nKate Benito\n\nWe have been with Blue Ray for the past 6 years and each experience has been seamless. We’ve had everything from water heaters replaced to clogged toilets/sinks serviced but recently had our kitchen sink faucet and toilet replaced and I couldn’t be morr grateful. They call you back right away, are professional, punctual and get the job done! Highly recommend.\n\nYR\n\nMy experience with Blueray is always positive. They are on time..reliable..Knowledgeable. I have used them several times and always satisfied with the work100%. I have a 88 years old mom and they are patient with her . Take time to talk with her and that is also important to me . I would highly recommend them.especially Matt.\n\nAlvidia Ortiz\n\n“Best HVAC company in New Jersey! Fair prices, quality work, and the summer discount made it even better.”\n\nMaria L. - Edison, NJ\n\n“Emergency repair during a heatwave. They arrived within 2 hours and had our AC running perfectly. Highly recommend!”\n\nJohn D. - Jersey City, NJ\n\n“Blue Ray installed our new AC system last month. Professional, efficient, and the 10% discount was a great bonus!”\n\nSarah M. - Newark, NJ\n\nFrozen pipe? Fixed before the damage spread. Couldn’t recommend them enough!\n\nOur heat went out in the middle of the night. Blueray was there within hours, absolute lifesavers!\n\nMy heating and cooling system has been better than ever since Matt came to fix them. He was recommended to me by some coworkers and it was the best decision of my life.\n\nMohammed Odatalla\n\nWe use them for all our plumbing, heating and cooling needs. Hamza is very knowledgeable and always helps find the best solution. Whenever I have a plumbing emergency I never panic because I know Blu-ray is only one phone call away. And the best part is they do residential and commercial they have worked in my house and my restaurants. Keep up the amazing work\n\nSaad Basra\n\nMatt came to check on the unit last week, he was nice and really honest with his opinion on the unit. We had initially called a different company, and Blueray was our second opinion. We decided to go with Blueray.\nWe just had our AC unit replaced today and we just want to share we had a good experience with Blueray HVAC. Thank you! Matt and Sam are very friendly and professional. I highly recommend them!\n\nKate Benito\n\nWe have been with Blue Ray for the past 6 years and each experience has been seamless. We’ve had everything from water heaters replaced to clogged toilets/sinks serviced but recently had our kitchen sink faucet and toilet replaced and I couldn’t be morr grateful. They call you back right away, are professional, punctual and get the job done! Highly recommend.\n\nYR\n\nMy experience with Blueray is always positive. They are on time..reliable..Knowledgeable. I have used them several times and always satisfied with the work100%. I have a 88 years old mom and they are patient with her . Take time to talk with her and that is also important to me . I would highly recommend them.especially Matt.\n\nAlvidia Ortiz\n\n“Best HVAC company in New Jersey! Fair prices, quality work, and the summer discount made it even better.”\n\nMaria L. - Edison, NJ\n\n“Emergency repair during a heatwave. They arrived within 2 hours and had our AC running perfectly. Highly recommend!”\n\nJohn D. - Jersey City, NJ\n\n“Blue Ray installed our new AC system last month. Professional, efficient, and the 10% discount was a great bonus!”\n\nSarah M. - Newark, NJ\n\nFrozen pipe? Fixed before the damage spread. Couldn’t recommend them enough!\n\nOur heat went out in the middle of the night. Blueray was there within hours, absolute lifesavers!\n\nOUR BLOG\n\nLatest Articles\nAIR CONDITIONINGHEATINGHVAC\n\nMaximizing Energy Efficiency: Tips for Your HVAC System\n\n2 years ago\nAs homeowners or property managers, we’re always looking for ways to save on energy costs without compromising comfort. Your HVAC…\nAIR CONDITIONINGHVAC\n\nSpring Refresh: Is Your AC Ready?\n\n2 years ago\nAs the chill of winter fades, spring brings a fresh start. It’s a time for renewal, and your air conditioning…\nAIR CONDITIONINGHEATINGHVAC\n\nUpgrade to Comfort: The Benefits of a Smart Thermostat\n\n2 years ago\nIn today’s tech-driven world, the concept of a smart home is no longer a novelty but a reality for many.…\nRead More\nWorking Hours\n\nMon-Fri: 9 AM – 6 PM\n\nSaturday: 9 AM – 4 PM\n\nSunday: Closed\n\nOffice\n\n91 Knapp Ave Clifton, NJ 07011\n\n+1 973 925 5556\nGet in Touch\n\nCopyright ©2025 Blueray HVAC, All Rights Reserved.",
