      "owners": [],
      "bodyText": "Home\nAbout Us\nServices\nWhy Us?\nFAQ\nArticles\nTestimonials\nContact Us\nContact Us\nAbout Us\nHomeAbout Us\n\nBLUERAY HEATING AND COOLING\n\nYour Trusted HVAC Experts in North Jersey\n\nWelcome to Blueray Heating and Cooling, the leading HVAC service provider in North Jersey! With a strong commitment to excellence and a track record of 20+ in the industry, we are dedicated to delivering top-tier heating, ventilation, and air conditioning solutions to residences and commercial establishments across the region.\n\nLocated in Clifton, New Jersey, our primary goal is to offer premium services that cater to all your HVAC requirements with exceptional care and precision. From installation to repairs, we are your reliable companion in ensuring optimum indoor comfort for your peace of mind.\n\nContact Us\n\nThe weather in North Jersey can be weird, so you need reliable HVAC services all year round. At Blueray Heating and Cooling, we recognize this challenge and have a team of expert technicians ready to provide tailored and efficient solutions for your specific needs. Whether you are combating the summer heat or the freezing winter chill, we have the knowledge and tools to keep you comfortable in all seasons.\n\nOur reputation for top-notch services precedes us, and we take pride in our commitment to delivering quality and exceptional customer service. Whether you require routine maintenance, emergency repairs, or a new system installation, you can rely on us to handle the job with precision and reliability.\n\nAs a locally-owned business deeply rooted in the community, we proudly serve all of North Jersey, including Clifton, Passaic, Paterson, and neighboring areas. By choosing Blueray Heating and Cooling, you are not just opting for a service provider – you are selecting a trustworthy company dedicated to surpassing your expectations with each service appointment.\n\nExperience the unparalleled service of Blueray today and witness why we are the preferred HVAC experts in North Jersey. Get in touch with us to schedule your service and let us assist you in creating the ideal indoor environment for your residence or business.\n\nContact Us\nContact us today!\n\nReady to experience the Blueray Heating and Cooling difference? Whether it’s an emergency or an installation, we’re only one click away!\n\n\tContact Us\nWorking Hours\n\nMon-Fri: 9 AM – 6 PM\n\nSaturday: 9 AM – 4 PM\n\nSunday: Closed\n\nOffice\n\n91 Knapp Ave Clifton, NJ 07011\n\n+1 973 925 5556\nGet in Touch\n\nCopyright ©2025 Blueray HVAC, All Rights Reserved.",
